Docs / AeoScript / Input
Input 
React to keys or read gameplay input.
Key events
on.keypress(key, down) {
if key == "F" && down {
debug.log("Attack")
}
}
down is true on press and false on release. Repeated keypress messages are suppressed. Losing window focus releases held keys.
Held keys
if input.is_key_down("F") {
debug.log("F is held")
}
Key names include "A", "1", "Space", "ArrowUp", and "Escape". A top-level check runs once at startup; use a relevant update or event when you need later input.
Gameplay controls
input.get_move_vector() returns two movement values. input.is_jump_pressed() reads jump input. input.get_orbit_delta() reads camera-orbit input.
Use get.mouse() to control cursor visibility and locking. See the Input reference.
